              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Izindaba ezinjalo zezwakala ezindlebeni zebandla laseJerusalema, bathuma uBarnabasi ukuba ahambe aze afike e-Antiyokiya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
