              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Owathi efika, esewubonile umusa kaNkulunkulu, wathokoza, wabakhuthaza bonke ukuthi banamathele eNkosini ngokuzimisela kwenhliziyo.",
          "type": "text",
